IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- Canada Pension Plan Act, Part I, Divisions A and B -- AMOUNT HELPERS (no provision).
--
-- Subsections 8(1.2), 8(2), 9(1.2), 10(1), 10(1.2), 13(3) to (3.2), 15.2 and 19 speak of "the amount by which" one amount
-- "exceeds" another. Where it does not exceed, there is no such amount; the rule gives 0 (NOTES.md, fork register).

§ `Amount helpers (no provision)`

GIVEN greater IS A NUMBER
      lesser IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the amount by which one amount exceeds another` greater lesser MEANS
    IF greater GREATER THAN lesser THEN greater MINUS lesser ELSE 0
